# A wide live set for the color modes: 156 allocations, 6 sites, 4 threads,
# sizes 16 B to 64 KiB, births spread over ~103 us. Laid out in ascending
# address order so each mode reads as a picture rather than as noise:
#   size   -> a gradient, since address order is size order within a block
#   age    -> a gradient, since address order is also birth order
#   site   -> six contiguous bands
#   thread -> a four-way interleave inside every band
# 125 of the 156 are still live at the end. A color mode has nothing to say
# about an empty map, so the frees are late and scattered.
